{"id":"719191db2e194527","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-creative-set-characterization-theorem.md","title":"Creative Set Characterization Theorem","display":"thm-creative-set-characterization-theorem — Creative Set Characterization Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-creative-set-characterization-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-creative-set-characterization-theorem"],"display":"thm-creative-set-characterization-theorem — Creative Set Characterization Theorem","depends_on":["[[68-df-creative-set]]","[[68-df-m-completeness]]","[[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§17.1 p.63 / PDF 72","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-creative-set-characterization-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-creative-set-characterization-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-creative-set-characterization-theorem — Creative Set Characterization Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2afdb06f05dacdb0\" href=\"?note=2afdb06f05dacdb0\" title=\"68-df-creative-set\">68-df-creative-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5afd25b07b64f3c2\" href=\"?note=5afd25b07b64f3c2\" title=\"68-df-m-completeness\">68-df-m-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b8f02ef6e351ea3\" href=\"?note=3b8f02ef6e351ea3\" title=\"68-thm-s-m-n-theorem\">68-thm-s-m-n-theorem</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§17.1 p.63 / PDF 72"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative},\\mathrm{Creating}\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative},\\mathrm{Creating}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2afdb06f05dacdb0\" href=\"?note=2afdb06f05dacdb0\" title=\"68-df-creative-set\">68-df-creative-set</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{mComplete}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5afd25b07b64f3c2\" href=\"?note=5afd25b07b64f3c2\" title=\"68-df-m-completeness\">68-df-m-completeness</a>。参数化所用递归函数编号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3b8f02ef6e351ea3\" href=\"?note=3b8f02ef6e351ea3\" title=\"68-thm-s-m-n-theorem\">68-thm-s-m-n-theorem</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{mComplete}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{mComplete}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 17.1，印刷 p.63 / PDF p.72。若 A 为 RE 完全集，取将对角 RE 集 K 归约至 A 的全递归 F，再由参数定理取 S 使 W_(S(e))(x)↔W_e(F(x))；令 G(e)=F(S(e)) 即得到 creating function。反向，若 F creating，给任意 RE 集 B 取全递归 S 使 W_(S(x))(y)↔x∈B，则 x∈B↔F(S(x))∈A。两向均按原书证明复核。旧原子中补集生产性与一一完备性的外部等价结论另保存在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b933761613d185b9\" href=\"?note=b933761613d185b9\" title=\"68-thm-myhill-characterization\">68-thm-myhill-characterization</a>，与本书 17.1 的核验状态分开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-creative-set","status":"resolved","id":"2afdb06f05dacdb0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-creative-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-m-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"5afd25b07b64f3c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-m-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-s-m-n-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"3b8f02ef6e351ea3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-creative-set","status":"resolved","id":"2afdb06f05dacdb0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{Creative},\\mathrm{Creating}$ 见 [[68-df-creative-set]]，$\\mathrm{mComplete}$ 见 [[68-df-m-completeness]]。参数化所用递归函数编号见 [[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-m-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"5afd25b07b64f3c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{Creative},\\mathrm{Creating}$ 见 [[68-df-creative-set]]，$\\mathrm{mComplete}$ 见 [[68-df-m-completeness]]。参数化所用递归函数编号见 [[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-s-m-n-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"3b8f02ef6e351ea3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{Creative},\\mathrm{Creating}$ 见 [[68-df-creative-set]]，$\\mathrm{mComplete}$ 见 [[68-df-m-completeness]]。参数化所用递归函数编号见 [[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-myhill-characterization","status":"resolved","id":"b933761613d185b9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 17.1，印刷 p.63 / PDF p.72。若 A 为 RE 完全集，取将对角 RE 集 K 归约至 A 的全递归 F，再由参数定理取 S 使 W_(S(e))(x)↔W_e(F(x))；令 G(e)=F(S(e)) 即得到 creating function。反向，若 F creating，给任意 RE 集 B 取全递归 S 使 W_(S(x))(y)↔x∈B，则 x∈B↔F(S(x))∈A。两向均按原书证明复核。旧原子中补集生产性与一一完备性的外部等价结论另保存在 [[68-thm-myhill-characterization]]，与本书 17.1 的核验状态分开。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative},\\mathrm{Creating}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{mComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{mComplete}(A).","display":true}],"bytes":1517,"backlinks":[{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-creative-set-characterization-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-creative-set-characterization-theorem|thm-creative-set-characterization-theorem — Creative Set Characterization Theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["2afdb06f05dacdb0","5afd25b07b64f3c2","3b8f02ef6e351ea3","b933761613d185b9"]}